## 4. Other file jobs

| Need | Use |
|---|---|
| Teams, shared files, public images, replace, share links | `declared-files` → `declare`, `share-links` |
| A file your function creates, such as an export | `sw.fs.server.write`, then `sw.fs.server.signedUrl(path, { expiresIn })` (`declared-files` → `files-outside-a-collection`) |
